Date: Thu, 30 Apr 2026 16:29:27 +0100
Subject: Brightsign: Add MemoryPressureListenerTag for Electron
 MemoryPressureMonitor

Add kElectronMemoryPressureMonitor to MemoryPressureListenerTag (= 71)
to support the Electron MemoryPressureMonitor API after the
migration to subclass-based MemoryPressureListener and cppgc-managed
gin::Wrappable objects.

diff --git a/base/memory/memory_pressure_listener.h b/base/memory/memory_pressure_listener.h
index 24f83685065b6fff68e832bd0e41137abd6c1a1a..3665d2b8569927b7105c543f181eca9c4cf00189 100644
--- a/base/memory/memory_pressure_listener.h
+++ b/base/memory/memory_pressure_listener.h
@@ -101,6 +101,7 @@ enum class MemoryPressureListenerTag {
   kGrShaderCache = 68,
   kMemoryPressureListenerPolicy = 69,
   kLongScreenshotsTabService = 70,
+  kElectronMemoryPressureMonitor = 71,
 };
 
 // base::MemoryPressureListener is deprecated. Use base::MemoryConsumer instead.
